# Normain App — Permissions Catalog

> Permissions in the Normain app, mapped to roles. Feeds the roles/permissions section of the KPMG deliverable.
>
> Checkmarks below are **suggested defaults** — review and adjust.
>
> **Scoped variants:** team-level permissions split into a broad form ("any team") and an "…I'm a part of" form (only teams the actor belongs to).

